

## Run Local Stand Alone

### 1. Initialize the DB
```make init```

### 2. Seed the DB
```make seed```

### 3. Run stand alone app locally
```make run```

### 4. Run Unit Test
```make test```

### 5. Run Integration Test
```make test```

## Run Local Docker (docker compose)

### 1. Build the whole thing
```docker compose build```

#### Or build with no cache
```docker compose build --no-cache```

### 2. Run migrations (migrate DB first)
```docker compose run migrate```

### 3. Start blue stack
```docker compose up -d backend_blue nginx```

### 4. Deploy new version to green
```docker compose up -d --build backend_green```

### 5. Switch nginx upstream to green
```docker exec nginx nginx -s reload```

### 6. View log on a certain container
``` docker logs -f backend_blue```

### 7. Log into a certain container
```docker exec -it backend_blue```

### 8. Start the whole thing
```docker compose up -d```

### 9. Shutdow the whole thing
```docker compose down -v```

### 10. List all running containers
```docker ps```

### 11. List all docker images
```docker images```

### 12. Delete docker images
```docker rmi -f ImageID```

### 13. Stop a docker running instance
```docker stop ContainID```